{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgVA8t3cDglVJZOIJRt8h","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to build a multi-screen Figma prototype, and I'm working through what I need in order to move. I've settled the asset-reuse question: the wordmark is 18185 characters, far too large to rebuild by hand, and the image hashes are the same file's hashes, so re-embedding raw bytes is unnecessary — I can reuse imageHash directly through fills within the same file. The cleaner path is cloning: `node.clone()` preserves image fills and vector geometry, so I can clone the wordmark group, the Avatar_Neutral children (2 kids), the 18 icons, and the burger images from 04 Media into a library on the Workspace page.\n\nSet up the design system: brand red #EF2A39, dark brown #3C2F2F, surface #F7F4F2, muted text #8A7F7F, border #EDE7E5, star #FF9633, success green #2FA84F. Type is Roboto: display 32/Bold, h1 26/Bold, h2 20/Bold, body 14/Regular, label 13/Medium, caption 12/Regular. Radii: 12 small, 20 cards, 28 hero, pill chips. Every frame 430 × 932.\n\nLay out 02_Home: status bar 44, header row at y=44 (avatar 44×44 left, wordmark 100 wide right), headline at y=110 in 32/38 two lines, search row at y=200 (flex field + 56×56 filter button), category chips at y=264 (All active, Combos, Sliders, Classic), section row at y=320, then 4 cards of 104 with 12 gaps = 464, ending at 816. Bottom nav 844–932. That fits 932 with no overlap.\n\nProducts carry distinct data: Cheeseburger Wendy's 4.9 / 26 mins / $8.24 / portion 1; Veggie 4.8 / 14 mins / $9.99 / portion 1; Chicken 4.6 / 42 mins / $6.24 / portion 2 = $12.48; Fried Chicken 4.5 / 14 mins / $6.75 / portion 4 = $27.00.\n\n07_Customize needs 7 toppings in a 4-column grid (2 rows of 96) plus 5 sides (2 rows), portion stepper at 2, spice level, and total $16.48. Summing the stack gives roughly 1240, so that frame is 430 × 1240 with a sticky order bar. 08_Payment shows Mastercard selected and Visa, save toggle on, total $18.28. 09 is 08 duplicated as background, dimmed, with the dialog on top. 10_Profile and 11_Support_Chat (7 messages with timestamps) round it out.\n\nPrototype links: 01 → 02 after a 2000 ms delay; 4 menu cards → product frames; tabs → 10 and 11; product backs → 02; Order Now → 07; 07 back → 03, Order Now → 08; 08 back → 07, Pay Now → 09; 09 Go Back → 02; 10 and 11 backs → 02.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":52,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3255,"cache_read_input_tokens":64287,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3255,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5c4b085e-0924-4a6a-9e18-2faff92322bc","uuid":"a24c386f-6f9a-4cf3-9c8f-83028b15201e","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:06:48.473Z","thinking_duration_ms":38530}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgVA8t3cDglVJZOIJRt8h","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've gathered the geometry and media hashes. My plan: clone the reference icons, platform shell, media assets and base components into a component library on the Workspace page, then build all 11 screens from instances of those components, then wire the prototype. Starting with the platform shell, base components and icon set."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":52,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3255,"cache_read_input_tokens":64287,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":3255,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5c4b085e-0924-4a6a-9e18-2faff92322bc","uuid":"218c7f88-befb-4176-8265-4c8c9ae7b563","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:06:50.129Z"}
