{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgVBb8MuooOeXCD65T8jm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to gather the remaining screens and wire the prototype in a single response, since all the screens exist and nothing on the list depends on another item's result. The frames are 07 (2018:485), 08 (2018:643), 09 (2018:710), 10 (2018:753) and 11 (2018:836), with 01_Splash at 2014:119 and 02_Home at 2014:143. I wire 01_Splash to 02_Home after 2000ms, the 02_Home cards to 03, 04, 05 and 06, the nav instance 2014:292 groups to 10 and 11, and each screen's Back to 02_Home. 07 goes to 08 via Order Now, 08 to 09 via Pay Now, and 09's Go Back returns to 02_Home. I then capture 07 through 11 at around 900px to check the layouts.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10619,"cache_read_input_tokens":164796,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":10619,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5c4b085e-0924-4a6a-9e18-2faff92322bc","uuid":"f5823beb-6b8a-4a3d-a2a2-6a1e30811729","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:23:51.549Z","thinking_duration_ms":12029}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgVBb8MuooOeXCD65T8jm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Privately I need: screenshots of the five new screens (07–11) to catch layout faults, and the prototype wiring. The screens all exist now, so neither waits on the other. I'll run both in this response."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10619,"cache_read_input_tokens":164796,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":10619,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5c4b085e-0924-4a6a-9e18-2faff92322bc","uuid":"7afcc63f-01e0-49ab-9162-8371900ea74d","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:23:52.546Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgVBb8MuooOeXCD65T8jm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01gG1dDSPKyUWINLpZZHxUOX","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"\nconst ws=figma.root.children.find(function(p){return p.id==='2003:2';});\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(ws);\nconst F=function(n){return ws.findOne(function(x){return x.name===n;});};\nconst nav=function(dest){return [{type:'NODE',destinationId:dest,navigation:'NAVIGATE',transition:{type:'DISSOLVE',duration:0.3,easing:{type:'EASE_OUT'}},preserveScrollPosition:false}];};\nfunction link(node,dest){ node.reactions=[{trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'},actions:nav(dest)}]; }\nconst splash='2014:119', home='2014:143', p3='2014:332', p4='2014:394', p5='2014:456', p6='2014:518';\nconst cz='2018:485', pay='2018:643', ov='2018:710', pf='2018:753', chat='2018:836';\n\n// Splash auto-advance + click\nconst sp=figma.getNodeById(splash);\nsp.reactions=[{trigger:{type:'AFTER_TIMEOUT',timeout:2200},actions:nav(home)},{trigger:{type:'ON_CLICK'},actions:nav(home)}];\n\n// Home cards\nconst h=figma.getNodeById(home);\nconst map={\"Menu Card/Wendy's Burger\":p3,'Menu Card/Veggie Burger':p4,'Menu Card/Chicken Burger':p5,'Menu Card/Fried Chicken Burger':p6};\nh.children.forEach(function(c){ if(map[c.name]){ link(c,map[c.name]); } });\n// Home nav tabs\nconst navBar=h.children.filter(function(c){return c.type==='INSTANCE'&&c.name==='Bottom Navigation';})[0];\nif(navBar){\n  const profile=navBar.findOne(function(n){return n.name==='Nav/Profile';});\n  const support=navBar.findOne(function(n){return n.name==='Nav/Support';});\n  if(profile) link(profile,pf);\n  if(support) link(support,chat);\n}\nfunction findBack(f){ return f.children.filter(function(c){return (c.name==='Back'||c.name==='Icon Button')&&c.x<60&&c.width<60;})[0]; }\nfunction findByName(f,n){ return f.findAll(function(c){return c.name===n;})[0]; }\n\n// Products\n[[p3,cz],[p4,null],[p5,null],[p6,null]].forEach(function(pair){\n  const f=figma.getNodeById(pair[0]);\n  const b=findBack(f); if(b) link(b,home);\n  const on=findByName(f,'Order Now');\n  if(on&&pair[1]) link(on,pair[1]);\n});\n// Customize\nconst c7=figma.getNodeById(cz);\nlink(findBack(c7),p3);\nlink(findByName(c7,'Order Now'),pay);\n// Payment\nconst p8=figma.getNodeById(pay);\nlink(findBack(p8),cz);\nlink(findByName(p8,'Pay Now'),ov);\n// Overlay\nconst p9=figma.getNodeById(ov);\nlink(findByName(p9,'Go Back'),home);\n// Profile\nconst p10=figma.getNodeById(pf);\nlink(findBack(p10),home);\n// Support\nconst p11=figma.getNodeById(chat);\nlink(findBack(p11),home);\n\nconst report={splash:sp.reactions.length,home:Object.keys(map).length,seven:c7.reactions.length};\nreturn JSON.stringify(report);\n","description":"Wire prototype flows between states","fileKey":"X4FFaqwjpE7db5KGMtMR8O"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":10619,"cache_read_input_tokens":164796,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":10619,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5c4b085e-0924-4a6a-9e18-2faff92322bc","uuid":"7ab808a6-8ec5-493c-baaa-e9151341f2a9","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:23:58.365Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01gG1dDSPKyUWINLpZZHxUOX","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
