{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgVBjfFa45gCXvHsnSu6w","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to make a fix pass in the file: set the status bar and home indicator fills to red on Splash, resize the success mark to 80x80, hide the instance children's icons in 10_Profile's entry rows through `visible=false` inside try/catch, append an icon overlay to the frame at the row coordinates (40, rowY+20), and fix the log out button width. The appendChild into Entry Row is what failed, since Entry Row is an instance and I cannot add children into it. I also request metadata for the workspace and screenshots of 04, 05 and 06, which do not depend on the fix.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2596,"cache_read_input_tokens":184320,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2596,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5c4b085e-0924-4a6a-9e18-2faff92322bc","uuid":"efe73753-94c4-4798-b45a-b0d362faec2f","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:26:26.686Z","thinking_duration_ms":8157}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgVBjfFa45gCXvHsnSu6w","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Privately, what I still need:\n- Splash: white status bar and home indicator strips break the full-bleed red, so their containers must take the brand red.\n- 09: the success mark still renders as a pill because the tick frame shrank to its child; it needs a forced 80×80 and full radius.\n- 10: the back-button title overlap, the shrunken Log out button, and the wrong lock glyphs on the two entry rows all still need fixing. The last attempt aborted because I appended icons into a component instance, which Figma forbids.\n- Prototype: reactions were never audited because that call aborted, so I don't yet know if the in-instance links landed.\n- Verification: Splash and Home look right; products 04–06 are unverified.\n\nThe fix pass and the product screenshots are independent of each other, so I'll send them together."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2596,"cache_read_input_tokens":184320,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2596,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5c4b085e-0924-4a6a-9e18-2faff92322bc","uuid":"7a1bf63d-7e6f-4f35-91b6-ce8527d813be","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:26:31.851Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgVBjfFa45gCXvHsnSu6w","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01mlfOdxTh4vhnefIdKwEpOW","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"\nconst ws=figma.root.children.find(function(p){return p.id==='2003:2';});\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(ws);\nawait figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Roboto',style:'Medium'});\nawait figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Roboto',style:'SemiBold'});\nfunction C(h){return {r:parseInt(h.slice(1,3),16)/255,g:parseInt(h.slice(3,5),16)/255,b:parseInt(h.slice(5,7),16)/255};}\nfunction S(h){return [{type:'SOLID',color:C(h)}];}\nconst RED='#EF2A39',BROWN='#3C2F2F',MUTED='#8A7B7B';\nconst log=[];\n\n// --- Splash: make system chrome blend into red ---\nconst sp=figma.getNodeById('2014:119');\n['Status Bar','Home Indicator'].forEach(function(nm){\n  const inst=sp.findOne(function(n){return n.name===nm;});\n  if(inst){ inst.fills=S(RED); log.push('bg '+nm); }\n});\n\n// --- 09: force circular success mark ---\nconst ov=figma.getNodeById('2018:710');\nconst tick=ov.findOne(function(n){return n.name==='Success Mark';});\nif(tick){\n  tick.layoutSizingHorizontal='FIXED'; tick.layoutSizingVertical='FIXED';\n  tick.resize(80,80); tick.cornerRadius=40;\n  log.push('tick '+Math.round(tick.width)+'x'+Math.round(tick.height));\n}\n\n// --- 10: title, log out, entry icons ---\nconst pf=figma.getNodeById('2018:753');\nconst title=pf.findOne(function(n){return n.name==='Screen Title';});\nif(title){ title.x=88; title.y=63; log.push('title ok'); }\nconst lo=pf.findOne(function(n){return n.name==='Log out'&&n.type==='FRAME';});\nif(lo){ lo.layoutSizingHorizontal='FIXED'; lo.resize(382,56); lo.primaryAxisAlignItems='CENTER'; log.push('logout w='+Math.round(lo.width)); }\n[['Entry/Order history','2006:128',634],['Entry/Payment Details','2006:81',710]].forEach(function(pair){\n  const row=pf.findOne(function(n){return n.name===pair[0];});\n  if(!row){ log.push('no row '+pair[0]); return; }\n  row.findAll(function(n){ if(n.type==='INSTANCE'&&n.x<40&&n.width===24){ try{ n.visible=false; }catch(e){} } return false; });\n  const icon=figma.getNodeById(pair[1]).createInstance();\n  pf.appendChild(icon); icon.name='Row Icon'; icon.x=40; icon.y=pair[2]+20;\n  icon.findAll(function(n){return n.type==='VECTOR';}).forEach(function(v){ v.fills=S(BROWN); });\n  log.push('icon '+pair[0]);\n});\n\n// --- audit reactions ---\nconst screens=['01_Splash','02_Home','03_Product_Cheeseburger','04_Product_Veggie','05_Product_Chicken','06_Product_Fried_Chicken','07_Customize','08_Payment','09_Payment_Success_Overlay','10_Profile','11_Support_Chat'];\nconst audit={};\nscreens.forEach(function(nm){\n  const f=ws.findOne(function(n){return n.name===nm;});\n  if(!f){audit[nm]='MISSING';return;}\n  const hits=[];\n  f.findAll(function(n){ if(n.reactions&&n.reactions.length){ hits.push(n.name+' > '+(n.reactions[0].actions[0]?n.reactions[0].actions[0].destinationId:'?')); } return false; });\n  audit[nm]=hits;\n});\nreturn JSON.stringify({log:log,audit:audit});\n","description":"Fix splash chrome, success mark, profile layout; audit links","fileKey":"X4FFaqwjpE7db5KGMtMR8O"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2596,"cache_read_input_tokens":184320,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2596,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5c4b085e-0924-4a6a-9e18-2faff92322bc","uuid":"6b3e1256-95e3-40e8-8b65-0c994a5bef34","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:26:34.596Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01mlfOdxTh4vhnefIdKwEpOW","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
