{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgVBqY0rAxWWQRqgGWHC7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to verify the Home screen after the card tightening, where the cards at 392, 500, 608, 716 end at 816 and stay above the nav at 842. I check 09 and 10 and both look good, and Splash looks good now. In 09 the dialog sits at y=276 with \"Go Back\" ending cleanly, and the payment screen behind sits under the scrim. In 10 the avatar is an acceptable crop and Log out is now full width. The remaining minor issue is 07_Customize: the selected badge on the added tiles renders as a red blob top-right, a 20x20 circle with a white check that reads as a splotch. I fix this by resizing the badges to 20x20 radius 10 with fixed sizing and forcing the check icon to 10x10, across the Topping/Tomato, Topping/Cheese and Side/Fries tiles plus the component masters at 2012:161, then screenshot 02_Home to verify the card stack. The two tasks are independent, so both go in one response. Checklist items for 02, 03, 08, 10 and 11 are all covered.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4944,"cache_read_input_tokens":193274,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4944,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5c4b085e-0924-4a6a-9e18-2faff92322bc","uuid":"25b827d6-665c-48e4-928a-fafc22f9f122","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:28:04.764Z","thinking_duration_ms":9350}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgVBqY0rAxWWQRqgGWHC7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Privately, what I still need:\n- **02_Home verification** — the menu cards were re-stacked to end at 816 so they clear the bottom nav, but I have not seen the result.\n- **07_Customize polish** — the \"added\" badge on Tomato, Cheese and Fries renders as a red blob instead of a clean check mark; the badge frame inside those instances needs fixed sizing.\n- **Final delivery summary** — file URL, workspace page ID, all 11 screen IDs, prototype links, and remaining limitations.\n\nThe Home check and the badge fix touch different frames, so I'll send both now."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4944,"cache_read_input_tokens":193274,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4944,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5c4b085e-0924-4a6a-9e18-2faff92322bc","uuid":"41c8553a-a0d7-44ec-bfe7-8f36ceb5ff66","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:28:09.129Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgVBqY0rAxWWQRqgGWHC7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01RXZGvMqh602V4S27QOMPak","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"\nconst ws=figma.root.children.find(function(p){return p.id==='2003:2';});\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(ws);\nconst sz=function(n,w,h){ n.layoutSizingHorizontal='FIXED'; n.layoutSizingVertical='FIXED'; n.resize(w,h); };\nconst out=[];\n\n// Fix the master \"Added\" tile badge so instances inherit a clean circle\nconst master=ws.findOne(function(n){return n.id==='2012:161';});\nif(master){\n  const badge=master.findOne(function(n){return n.name==='Badge';});\n  if(badge){ sz(badge,22,22); badge.cornerRadius=11; out.push('master badge '+Math.round(badge.width)); }\n}\n\n// Fix every added tile placed on 07_Customize\nconst cz=figma.getNodeById('2018:485');\n['Topping/Tomato','Topping/Cheese','Side/Fries'].forEach(function(nm){\n  const tile=cz.findOne(function(n){return n.name===nm;});\n  if(!tile){ out.push('missing '+nm); return; }\n  const badge=tile.findOne(function(n){return n.name==='Badge';});\n  if(badge){\n    sz(badge,22,22); badge.cornerRadius=11;\n    const ic=badge.findOne(function(n){return n.type==='INSTANCE';});\n    if(ic&&ic.width>14){ sz(ic,11,11); }\n    out.push(nm+' badge '+Math.round(badge.width));\n  }\n});\n// Give the \"Selected 2\" / \"Selected 1\" counters accurate values\nconst heads=cz.findAll(function(n){return n.name==='Section Header';});\nheads.forEach(function(h){\n  const a=h.findOne(function(n){return n.name==='Action';});\n  const t=h.findOne(function(n){return n.name==='Title';});\n  if(t&&a){\n    if(t.characters==='Toppings') a.characters='Selected 2';\n    if(t.characters==='Side options') a.characters='Selected 1';\n  }\n});\nreturn JSON.stringify(out);\n","description":"Fix added-tile badges on customize screen and master","fileKey":"X4FFaqwjpE7db5KGMtMR8O"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4944,"cache_read_input_tokens":193274,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4944,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5c4b085e-0924-4a6a-9e18-2faff92322bc","uuid":"543fba7b-14c3-4551-98bb-556b0c2f23f9","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:28:09.941Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01RXZGvMqh602V4S27QOMPak","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
