{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgVC8sgawFYZSM2zRIOvX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The copy audit passes, but the payment rows say \"Mastercard card\" and \"Visa card\" where the brief calls for \"Credit card (Mastercard, ...)\" and \"Debit card (Visa, ...)\". I fix those labels on 08 and 09, then take screenshots of Home (card fix) and Customize (badges), which the label fix doesn't touch.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2937,"cache_read_input_tokens":203296,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2937,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5c4b085e-0924-4a6a-9e18-2faff92322bc","uuid":"3fccd64a-4300-4c2a-bb50-c464497c14c6","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:32:28.987Z","thinking_duration_ms":2938}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgVC8sgawFYZSM2zRIOvX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Next I need: (1) the card-row labels corrected — the brief says \"Credit card\" and \"Debit card\", mine read \"Mastercard card\" and \"Visa card\"; (2) verification screenshots of Home after the card refit and Customize after the badge fix; (3) then the handoff summary. The label fix touches 08/09 only, so the Home and Customize screenshots are independent of it and can go in the same response."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2937,"cache_read_input_tokens":203296,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2937,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5c4b085e-0924-4a6a-9e18-2faff92322bc","uuid":"33e9dc7a-6ee5-4cde-9209-95551ebad309","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:32:31.317Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgVC8sgawFYZSM2zRIOvX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01ulynG9uBPg9y1ekTQ5c3Uy","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"\nconst ws=figma.root.children.find(function(p){return p.id==='2003:2';});\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(ws);\nawait figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Roboto',style:'SemiBold'});\nconst out=[];\n[['08_Payment'],['09_Payment_Success_Overlay']].forEach(function(pair){\n  const f=ws.findOne(function(n){return n.name===pair[0];});\n  if(!f){ out.push('missing '+pair[0]); return; }\n  const mc=f.findOne(function(n){return n.name==='Card/Mastercard';});\n  const vs=f.findOne(function(n){return n.name==='Card/Visa';});\n  if(mc){ const t=mc.findOne(function(n){return n.name==='Brand';}); if(t){ t.characters='Credit card'; out.push(pair[0]+' credit'); } }\n  if(vs){ const t=vs.findOne(function(n){return n.name==='Brand';}); if(t){ t.characters='Debit card'; out.push(pair[0]+' debit'); } }\n});\nconst master=ws.findOne(function(n){return n.name==='Payment Method Row';});\nif(master){\n  master.children.forEach(function(c){\n    const t=c.findOne(function(n){return n.name==='Brand';});\n    if(!t){return;}\n    if(c.name==='State=Selected'){ t.characters='Credit card'; }\n    if(c.name==='State=Unselected'){ t.characters='Debit card'; }\n  });\n  out.push('master labels');\n}\nreturn JSON.stringify(out);\n","description":"Correct payment card labels to credit and debit","fileKey":"X4FFaqwjpE7db5KGMtMR8O"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2937,"cache_read_input_tokens":203296,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2937,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5c4b085e-0924-4a6a