{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgVChNikT0QEN0P6TCQ0x","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I finished the design. All eleven screens exist in the workspace, verified by screenshot, and the prototype is wired.\n\n**File:** https://www.figma.com/design/X4FFaqwjpE7db5KGMtMR8O/\n**Page:** `03 · Workspace` — ID `2003:2`\n\n**Screens** (430 px wide; Splash through Home sits in row one, 07–11 in row two; Customize is 1420 tall so the full scroll content is visible):\n\n| Screen | Node ID |\n|---|---|\n| 01_Splash | `2014:119` |\n| 02_Home | `2014:143` |\n| 03_Product_Cheeseburger | `2014:332` |\n| 04_Product_Veggie | `2014:394` |\n| 05_Product_Chicken | `2014:456` |\n| 06_Product_Fried_Chicken | `2014:518` |\n| 07_Customize | `2018:485` |\n| 08_Payment | `2018:643` |\n| 09_Payment_Success_Overlay | `2018:710` |\n| 10_Profile | `2018:753` |\n| 11_Support_Chat | `2018:836` |\n\n**Design system.** Two brand colors as specified: red `#EF2A39` and dark brown `#3C2F2F`. Everything else I defined once: warm surface `#F7F2F0`, muted text `#8A7B7B`, hairline `#F0E6E3`, rating amber, success green. Roboto throughout with a Bold 26 heading scale; the Lobster wordmark is the supplied outlined vector, recolored white only on the Splash. Radii run 16 / 24 / 32, cards carry a soft warm shadow.\n\n**Components reused across screens.** `Foodgo · Components` (node `2009:2`) holds fourteen: category chip (default/active), primary button (default/disabled), ghost button, icon button, stepper, spice selector (mild/medium/hot), menu item card (normal/favourite), payment method row (selected/unselected), bottom navigation (Home/Profile/Support), add-on tile (default/added), chat bubble (agent/customer), profile row, entry row, section header. The platform shell, all eighteen icons and every food image are cloned from the reference pages into `Assets · Platform & Icons` (`2006:2`) and `Assets · Media` (`2006:131`). Reference pages are untouched.\n\n**Prototype.** Splash auto-advances to Home after 2.2 s and also on tap. Home's four cards open 03–06; the Profile and Support tabs open 10 and 11. Each product's back returns to Home; Order Now on the Cheeseburger opens Customize, which returns to 03. Customize's Order Now opens Payment; Payment's back returns to Customize and Pay Now opens the success overlay. The overlay's Go Back returns to Home, as do the backs on Profile and Support.\n\n**Copy and data.** All values follow the brief: totals of `$16.48` and `$18.28`, portions 1 / 1 / 2 / 4 with their matching prices, active tomato, cheese and fries, the seven-message chat with \"26 minutes ago\" after the agent's third message, and the card labels \"Credit card\" and \"Debit card\".\n\n**Limitations.** Home's fourth card ends 8 px above the bottom bar, which is tight but not clipped; on a shorter device the last card would need the scroll view the brief permits. The \"added\" badge on Customize sits just outside the tile rather than on its corner. Settings, search, filter, Order history, Payment Details and Log out are entry-only with no prototype destination, matching the brief. The chat send button and the order flow beyond the success dialog are static."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5019,"cache_read_input_tokens":216736,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5019,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5c4b085e-0924-4a6a-9e18-2faff92322bc","uuid":"b967e529-7ed5-4194-9084-6fb20bcdf0e1","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:40:00.174Z"}
